{"server":"tw","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_ex04_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_ex04","title":"碧血金沙","storyCode":"GT-HX-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_ex04_end.txt","sourceHash":"fd1cc535af4b2ce686f32ad8fc740621a9d34cf7c87d1bf16d0fa20fc15a99ab","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼，你要走了嗎？那位斯卡蒂小姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我該回羅德島覆命了，會找時間回來看你的。斯卡蒂說喜歡獨處，一個人先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"有斯卡蒂的名聲在，不會有賞金獵人再來騷擾你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻，是啊，恢復生產可能還需要一點時間，但......這是新生活的開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"路上小心。下次就到豐收的季節再來吧，讓我好好招待你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，那說定了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，信使剛剛送來這封信。雖然說是發給滴水村的，但收信人寫的是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這是羅德島的信封，應該是從聯絡處的通訊轉錄過來的吧。這裡幾乎收不到訊號，也難為大家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看......"},{"type":"narration","text":"（格拉尼啟，斯卡蒂已擅自前往滴水村，未任命其任何任務，小心對待。）\n（祝一切順利     臨光）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這個，我早就清楚啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你在幹什麼，格拉尼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"折紙飛機啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的信紙材料很好，能飛很遠呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]}]}
